{"id": "d9784295-740b-489b-b6f9-ead131ee0213", "slug": "synapse-quant-analytics", "title": "Synapse // Quant Analytics", "description": "Synapse Quant Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Synapse // Quant Analytics\"\ndescription: \"Synapse Quant Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#030303\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#030303\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Synapse // Quant Analytics\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 3; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nSynapse Quant Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSYNAPSE // CORE BUILD_7.1.9 SYNCED Algorithmic Topologies 01// Mapping multidimensional datasets to uncover hidden market structures. The topology engine continuously renders variance in real-time. Protocol: Stochastic…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Protocol: Stochastic; State: Evaluation; Output: Calibrated.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #030303, accent #FFFFFF, background #030303, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Synapse // Quant Analytics</title>\n\n    <!-- Dependencies -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Typography -->\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        zinc: { 900: '#18181b', 950: '#09090b' }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030303] text-zinc-400 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-white/20 min-h-screen flex flex-col overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Global Grid Background -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 4rem 4rem;\">\n        <!-- Ambient Top Glow -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-white/[0.03] blur-[120px] rounded-full\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Top Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"w-full relative z-20 bg-[#030303]/80 backdrop-blur-md\">\n        <!-- Top subtle gradient line -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 inset-x-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-px border-b border-white/5\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-white tracking-tight\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" width=\"20\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px;\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>SYNAPSE // CORE</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500\">\n                <span class=\"hidden sm:block\">BUILD_7.1.9</span>\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-400\">\n                    <span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                      <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                      <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500\"></span>\n                    </span>\n                    SYNCED\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Workspace -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-center py-12 lg:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6\">\n\n        <!-- Grid Container -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative\">\n\n            <!-- Panel 01: Topologies -->\n            <div class=\"card-panel group relative flex flex-col justify-between h-[500px] lg:h-[700px] bg-zinc-950/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/5 overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-700 hover:bg-zinc-900/40\">\n                <!-- Premium Border Gradient -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-white/20 via-white/5 to-transparent opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/5 to-white/20 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col h-full relative z-10\">\n                    <!-- Header -->\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase\">\n                        <span class=\"text-zinc-200 font-medium tracking-tight font-sans text-lg mask-word-reveal\">Algorithmic Topologies</span>\n                        <span class=\"mask-word-reveal\">01//</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-[260px] mask-word-reveal font-light\">\n                        Mapping multidimensional datasets to uncover hidden market structures. The topology engine continuously renders variance in real-time.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <!-- Visual -->\n                    <div class=\"relative flex-grow flex items-center justify-center py-8\">\n                        <canvas id=\"quant-canvas-1\" class=\"w-full max-w-[260px] aspect-square opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-1000\"></canvas>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Footer -->\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-white/5 pt-6 mt-auto\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300 mb-2 mask-word-reveal\">Protocol: Stochastic</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed font-light mask-word-reveal\">\n                            Synapse identifies non-linear correlations previously invisible to standard analytics.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Panel 02: Heuristics -->\n            <div class=\"card-panel group relative flex flex-col justify-between h-[500px] lg:h-[700px] bg-zinc-950/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/5 overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-700 hover:bg-zinc-900/40\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col h-full relative z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase\">\n                        <span class=\"text-zinc-200 font-medium tracking-tight font-sans text-lg mask-word-reveal\">Heuristic Models</span>\n                        <span class=\"mask-word-reveal\">02//</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-[260px] mask-word-reveal font-light\">\n                        Evaluating probabilistic outcomes through layered neural execution. Optimizing pathfinding across high-frequency trading networks.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative flex-grow flex items-center justify-center py-8\">\n                        <canvas id=\"quant-canvas-2\" class=\"w-full max-w-[260px] aspect-square opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-1000\"></canvas>\n                        <!-- Center icon decoration -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-700\">\n                             <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-linear\" width=\"48\" style=\"stroke-width: 1px;\" class=\"animate-[spin_10s_linear_infinite]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-white/5 pt-6 mt-auto\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300 mb-2 mask-word-reveal\">State: Evaluation</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed font-light mask-word-reveal\">\n                            Models adapt dynamically, bridging theoretical frameworks with empirical execution environments.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Panel 03: Vectors -->\n            <div class=\"card-panel group relative flex flex-col justify-between h-[500px] lg:h-[700px] bg-zinc-950/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/5 overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-700 hover:bg-zinc-900/40\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/5 to-white/20 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-white/20 via-white/5 to-transparent opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col h-full relative z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase\">\n                        <span class=\"text-zinc-200 font-medium tracking-tight font-sans text-lg mask-word-reveal\">Predictive Vectors</span>\n                        <span class=\"mask-word-reveal\">03//</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-[260px] mask-word-reveal font-light\">\n                        Projecting future states by aggregating localized quantum fluctuations. Aligning capital deployment with emergent micro-trends.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative flex-grow flex items-center justify-center py-8\">\n                        <canvas id=\"quant-canvas-3\" class=\"w-full max-w-[260px] aspect-square opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-1000\"></canvas>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-white/5 pt-6 mt-auto\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300 mb-2 mask-word-reveal\">Output: Calibrated</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed font-light max-w-[200px] mask-word-reveal\">\n                                    Vectors indicate confluence of momentum and fundamental shifts.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Mini Data Graph Graphic -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-end gap-[2px] h-8 opacity-40 group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/40 h-2\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/60 h-4\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/30 h-3\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/80 h-7\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 bg-white/50 h-5\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer Interface -->\n    <footer class=\"w-full bg-[#030303]/90 backdrop-blur-md border-t border-white/5 relative z-20 mt-auto\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-14 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-wide\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:history-linear\"></iconify-icon> Latency: 1.2ms</span>\n                <span class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-minimalistic-linear\"></iconify-icon> Enc: SHA-3</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">Nodes</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">Terminal</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- Interactive & Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        // --- 1. Topography Canvas Engine ---\n        class TopologyEngine {\n            constructor(canvasId, type) {\n                this.canvas = document.getElementById(canvasId);\n                if(!this.canvas) return;\n                this.ctx = this.canvas.getContext('2d');\n                this.width = this.canvas.offsetWidth;\n                this.height = this.canvas.offsetHeight;\n                this.canvas.width = this.width * 2;\n                this.canvas.height = this.height * 2;\n                this.ctx.scale(2, 2);\n                this.cx = this.width / 2;\n                this.cy = this.height / 2;\n                this.type = type;\n\n                this.nodes = [];\n                this.links = [];\n                this.time = 0;\n\n                this.initStructures();\n                this.render();\n            }\n\n            initStructures() {\n                const numNodes = this.type === 'complex' ? 40 : 25;\n                const radius = 65;\n\n                for(let i=0; i<numNodes; i++) {\n                    // Spherical distribution\n                    const phi = Math.acos(-1 + (2 * i) / numNodes);\n                    const theta = Math.sqrt(numNodes * Math.PI) * phi;\n\n                    let x = radius * Math.cos(theta) * Math.sin(phi);\n                    let y = radius * Math.sin(theta) * Math.sin(phi);\n                    let z = radius * Math.cos(phi);\n\n                    // Add variance based on type\n                    if(this.type === 'lattice') {\n                        x = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 140;\n                        y = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 140;\n                        z = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 140;\n                    }\n\n                    this.nodes.push({\n                        baseX: x, baseY: y, baseZ: z,\n                        x: x, y: y, z: z,\n                        phase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2\n                    });\n                }\n\n                // Connect nearest neighbors\n                for(let i=0; i<this.nodes.length; i++) {\n                    for(let j=i+1; j<this.nodes.length; j++) {\n                        let d = Math.hypot(this.nodes[i].x - this.nodes[j].x, this.nodes[i].y - this.nodes[j].y, this.nodes[i].z - this.nodes[j].z);\n                        if(d < (this.type === 'complex' ? 55 : 85)) {\n                            this.links.push([i, j]);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            project(node) {\n                // Gentle rotation\n                const rotX = this.time * 0.003;\n                const rotY = this.time * 0.005;\n\n                let x1 = node.x * Math.cos(rotY) - node.z * Math.sin(rotY);\n                let z1 = node.z * Math.cos(rotY) + node.x * Math.sin(rotY);\n                let y1 = node.y * Math.cos(rotX) - z1 * Math.sin(rotX);\n                let z2 = z1 * Math.cos(rotX) + node.y * Math.sin(rotX);\n\n                const fov = 350;\n                const scale = fov / (fov + z2 + 100); // Push back slightly\n                return {\n                    x: x1 * scale + this.cx,\n                    y: y1 * scale + this.cy,\n                    z: z2,\n                    scale: scale\n                };\n            }\n\n            render() {\n                this.ctx.clearRect(0, 0, this.width, this.height);\n                this.time += 1;\n\n                // Animate nodes\n                this.nodes.forEach(n => {\n                    const wave = Math.sin(this.time * 0.02 + n.phase) * (this.type === 'lattice' ? 10 : 3);\n                    n.x = n.baseX + wave;\n                    n.y = n.baseY + wave;\n                    n.z = n.baseZ + wave;\n                });\n\n                const projected = this.nodes.map(n => this.project(n));\n\n                // Draw Links\n                this.ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                this.links.forEach(l => {\n                    const p1 = projected[l[0]];\n                    const p2 = projected[l[1]];\n                    const zDepth = (p1.z + p2.z) / 2;\n                    const alpha = Math.max(0.05, 0.4 - (zDepth + 100) / 400);\n\n                    this.ctx.beginPath();\n                    this.ctx.moveTo(p1.x, p1.y);\n                    this.ctx.lineTo(p2.x, p2.y);\n                    this.ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${alpha})`;\n                    this.ctx.stroke();\n                });\n\n                // Draw Nodes\n                projected.forEach(p => {\n                    const alpha = Math.max(0.1, 0.8 - (p.z + 100) / 400);\n                    const size = Math.max(0.5, 2 * p.scale);\n\n                    this.ctx.beginPath();\n                    this.ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    this.ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${alpha})`;\n                    this.ctx.fill();\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(() => this.render());\n            }\n        }\n\n        // --- 2. GSAP Masked Word Reveal Logic ---\n        function initGSAPAnimations() {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Utility to split text into wrapped words for masking\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.mask-word-reveal');\n\n            revealElements.forEach(el => {\n                const words = el.innerText.trim().split(/\\s+/);\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    // Outer mask wrapper\n                    const maskDiv = document.createElement('span');\n                    maskDiv.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    maskDiv.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    maskDiv.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                    maskDiv.style.paddingRight = '0.25em'; // space between words\n                    maskDiv.style.lineHeight = '1.2'; // keep bounds tight\n\n                    // Inner animating element\n                    const innerDiv = document.createElement('span');\n                    innerDiv.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    innerDiv.innerHTML = word;\n                    innerDiv.classList.add('reveal-inner');\n\n                    maskDiv.appendChild(innerDiv);\n                    el.appendChild(maskDiv);\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Setup Timelines per Panel\n            const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.card-panel');\n\n            panels.forEach((panel, index) => {\n                let tl = gsap.timeline({\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: panel,\n                        start: \"top 85%\", // Trigger when top of panel hits 85% of viewport\n                        toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                    }\n                });\n\n                // Panel fade & slight slide up\n                tl.fromTo(panel,\n                    { opacity: 0, y: 40 },\n                    { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1, ease: \"power3.out\" },\n                    0\n                );\n\n                // Word Stagger Reveal\n                const words = panel.querySelectorAll('.reveal-inner');\n                if(words.length) {\n                    tl.fromTo(words,\n                        { y: \"120%\", rotationZ: 2 }, // start below mask, slight tilt\n                        { y: \"0%\", rotationZ: 0, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.015, ease: \"power4.out\" },\n                        0.2 // delay slightly after panel starts moving\n                    );\n                }\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Initialize on load\n        window.onload = () => {\n            // Start Canvas\n            new TopologyEngine('quant-canvas-1', 'lattice');\n            new TopologyEngine('quant-canvas-2', 'sphere');\n            new TopologyEngine('quant-canvas-3', 'complex');\n\n            // Start Scroll Animations\n            initGSAPAnimations();\n        };\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "synapse-quant-analytics.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/synapse-quant-analytics.jpg", "source_name": "synapse-quant-analytics-DESIGN.md", "views": 63, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T08:50:30.052209+00:00"}